              "name": "job_description",
              "value": "=We are looking for an AI Automation Specialist to design and build automated workflows that improve business processes and reduce repetitive manual tasks. The ideal candidate should have experience with workflow automation, n8n, API integrations, webhooks, data processing, and AI-powered automation. Experience working with JavaScript, JSON, and AI/LLM platforms is preferred. The candidate should be able to understand business processes, identify automation opportunities, and build reliable workflows that connect different business tools.",
